description.narrative:
Output: Transmission system expanded and upgraded through upgrade or construction of 132kv transmission lines and substations in Chittagong Division Indicator: 2b. 7 km of 132 kV underground transmission line constructed in Chittagong Division between Madunaghat and Kalurghat (Baseline: 0 km in 2014) Progress/Status: Completed. Construction work for 7.2 km of 132 kV underground transmission line completed. The line was charged in April 2022. Data Source: PGCB annual reports;
Quarterly progress reports from PGCB
Actual value:

Output: Transmission system expanded and upgraded through upgrade or construction of 132kv transmission lines and substations in Chittagong Division Indicator: 2c. 4 substations (132/33 kV) constructed or upgraded in Chittagong Division (Baseline: 0 nos in 2014) Progress/Status: Completed. One new AIS substation of 132/33 kV, 150 MVA at Kachua constructed and energized on 17 January 2021. One 132/33 kV substation at Madunaghat upgraded to GIS and energized on 28 December 2021. Upgradation at Comilla 132/33 kV GIS substation completed. The substation was energized in March 2022. Construction of new 132/33 kV GIS substation at Kalurghat completed. The substation was energized in April 2022. Data Source: PGCB annual reports;
Quarterly progress reports from PGCB
Actual value:

Output: Power generation system expanded and upgraded through replacement of an aging steam and gas turbine power plant of 220 megawatt (MW) capacity with a more efficient 400 MW gas-fired Combined Cycle Power Plant (CCPP) at Ashuganj Power Station complex Indicator: Power generation capacity at Ashuganj Power Station complex increased by 180 MW (to be jointly co-financed by IDB) (Baseline: 777 MW in 2014) Progress/Status: Overall progress 100%. EPC Contract signed on 20 March 2018. The old power plant demolished in November 2018. Construction of the new power plant started from February 2019. Commissioning of the new power plant completed in 25 oct 2022. Power Plant is now fully operational. Data Source: APSCL annual reports;
Quarterly progress reports from APSCL
Actual value:
